OL,3,GNEWSAHow one musician turned disability
OL,4,Aand isolation into a song
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen people talk about disability, the
OL,7,Fconversation often focuses on symptoms,
OL,8,Ftreatment and physical barriers.
OL,10,FLess often discussed is the loneliness
OL,11,Fthat can accompany chronic illness and
OL,12,Fdisability.
OL,14,FFor singer-songwriter Nikki Rous, a
OL,15,Fwheelchair user, that experience became
OL,16,Fthe inspiration for a new song
OL,17,Fexploring the isolation that can
OL,18,Faccompany disability and chronic
OL,19,Fillness.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
