OL,3,GNEWSAHow one musician turned disability
OL,4,Aand isolation into a song
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think as a disabled person, and
OL,7,F[with] many other people that suffer
OL,8,Ffrom chronic illness, chronic pain and
OL,9,Fdisability, there's a certain amount of
OL,10,Fisolation," she said.
